menu "Hilo Buddy"

config BUDDY_TZ_OFFSET_MIN
    int "Local time offset from UTC, in minutes"
    range -720 840
    default 0
    help
        The clock follows the envelope ts (UTC). Where the user sets the time zone is still pending.

config BUDDY_DEMO
    bool "Play a scripted demo Mac instead of starting BLE"
    default n

config BUDDY_SLEEP_BRIGHTNESS
    int "Panel brightness on the sleep clock (percent)"
    range 0 100
    default 20
    help
        The sleep clock is already drawn in dim colors; this lowers the panel itself too.

endmenu
